# Jak II, 0.1.8 (LIST-0.1.8 item 14, a tester: "in jak 2 i think the return to 1st person from pole when feet touch
# ground is acting funky. its like it goes 1st person then realizes its supposed to be 3rd"). Run with
# JAKVR_TEST_CONTINUE=ruins-start JAKVR_TEST_WARP=swingpole QUEST_SIM_ALIGN=10000 JAKVR_STATE_TRACE=1: a new game, the
# continue, then Jak put a metre over the ruins' nearest swing pole (frame 10000 is that moment); falling past it, he
# takes it. A late in the swing drops him back off it (Jak II takes A only 0.4 s into a swing and picks the jump by
# the swing's frame: early forward, then straight up and back onto the pole, late a drop); pictures as he falls and lands. With
# "Third person after a pole until you land" on (the start), the view is third person from the pole until his feet are
# down, then first person once, with no "view in play: first person" between ("[vr] view in play" and "[vr] state"
# lines); off (gkcfg-poleoff), in his eyes as he leaves the pole.
